            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A video decoding method according to the present disclosure includes the steps of: determining whether a merge motion difference coding method is applied to a current block; generating a merge candidate list for the current block; specifying a merge candidate for the current block based on the merge candidate list; and deriving a motion vector for the current block based on the merge candidate.</p>
            </abstract>
